{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49689","headline":"河传 · 阎选","name":"河传","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋雨，秋雨。\n无昼无夜，滴滴霏霏。\n暗灯凉簟怨分离，妖姬不胜悲。\n西风稍急喧窗竹，停又续，腻脸悬双玉。\n几回邀约雁来时，违期，雁归，人不归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎选","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}